        "Compatibility probes only: Roblox Sound properties are not assumed supported by Matcha. Nil/failed reads are unavailable, not false.",
        "Name hints do NOT confirm footsteps/gunshots or identify an enemy. Polling can miss short sounds. No sound is played or modified; this classic Sound probe is separate from named cue Part markers on EFFECTS."}
    for reason in pairs(S.coverage) do rows[#rows+1]="COVERAGE "..reason end
